"rather than a menu. Python still owns registration and every\n"
"operator the card invokes — C++ owns only pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
"Padajući izbornik profila / računa — otvara se s globalne gornje trake.\n"
"\n"
"Sadržaj crta izvorno `layout.mixar_profile_card()`\n"
